    "sleep_timer_accessibility_remaining" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver value for an active sleep timer. String Catalog variations.plural with CLDR categories per locale. Call sites must interpolate the minute count via String(localized:defaultValue:); String(format: String(localized:), n) cannot select a plural category.",
